<div class="build-map">
  <article class="build-lane">
    <span class="evidence">Published event lists</span>
    <h3>A / Search + pressure</h3>
    <p class="family-label">Keep the Wisdom engine; add ways to press the opponent.</p>
    <p><b>Example:</b> Nakaji, Nov 11 Bandai Store, 5–0. The list included four EB03-053 Nami, two OP15-119 Luffy, two OP14-108 Rayleigh, and four Shanks.</p>
    <p><b>Commit:</b> room for five-cost cards and a ten-cost close. Some pressure cards are not Wisdom, so they do not fit every search or Robin line.</p>
    <p><b>Ask:</b> did your search still find the engine, and did the pressure cards help before you ran out of time?</p>
    <a href="https://onepiecetopdecks.com/deck-list/japan-eb05op18-deck-list-heroines-and-the-dominance-of-god/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Published list roundup ↗</a>
  </article>
  <article class="build-lane">
    <span class="evidence">Published event lists</span>
    <h3>B / Trigger + Big Mom</h3>
    <p class="family-label">Use Trigger characters with Linlin and Sweet 3 Generals.</p>
    <p><b>Examples:</b> Toryu won Aichi on Nov 8; Purukoking was listed 5–0 on Nov 7. The Toryu list had three Linlin, four Sweet 3, four Megalo, and three Shanks. That 50-card list has zero Rayleigh, Borsalino, or Teach.</p>
    <p><b>Commit:</b> more high-cost plays and Trigger cards. Linlin's boost works on your turn only, and on eligible Trigger characters; it does not make every card Wisdom.</p>
    <p><b>Ask:</b> did the value package arrive in time, or did high-cost cards crowd your opening hand?</p>
    <a href="https://onepiecetopdecks.com/deck-list/japan-eb05op18-deck-list-heroines-and-the-dominance-of-god/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Published list roundup ↗</a>
  </article>
  <article class="build-lane">
    <span class="evidence">Simulator list</span>
    <h3>C / Life + control</h3>
    <p class="family-label">Trade some Wisdom slots for healing, blockers, and disruption.</p>
    <p><b>Example:</b> OPlay's second popular simulator list used four Teach, two Borsalino, two Shanks, two EB03-055 Robin, four EB05-056 Olvia, four Baby 5, and four OP14-118.</p>
    <p><b>Report:</b> 55% over 1,785 games and 311 players overall. This is an observed simulator result, not a cause, a tournament finish, or a Rocks/Luffy result.</p>
    <p><b>Commit:</b> fewer Wisdom bodies in some slots. Borsalino and Baby 5 are not free plays for six-cost Robin.</p>
    <a href="https://oplaytcg.com/deck-builder?d=2kFAocIGG6IIHSIKCHDLhpw34ccOcAwcMA0ccA4dsBAd8BEFmNuy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open this simulator list ↗</a>
  </article>
