    <h3>E / Thriller Bark recursion</h3>
    <p>Suda's Nov 7 Heroines Cup 3v3 list was reported 5–0 with placing not listed. It included Kumacy, Hogback, Perona, Moria, and Teach. This team-event record is not open-field 1v1 proof.</p>
    <p><b>Commit:</b> several slots and cards in the trash that can be played back. Non-KO removal can stop an on-KO effect from paying you.</p>
