<p class="callout"><strong>Not five separate camps:</strong> lists mix these jobs. Dalen's Nov 12 winning list included two EB05-056 Olvia, two Borsalino, four Rayleigh, three Megalo, three Shanks, two Linlin, and two Sweet 3. This shows overlap—not a required package.</p>
